 "1110331655244965", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619602_1110331661911631_9134180739597739341_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DdMLg1YU_cQQ7kNvwG3lCMw&_nc_oc=Adp5QXa-wy902FLL1r29Eak_Zdh7tICBUDD1mJu4fh_K2_T0684QIdh7Gxf3yD244QY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTggVmHNwl7lGibKscuFd-pjgYzdjU7NkQ4bRdU7Pikaw&oe=6B0DC7EC"}]}, "id": "2037764473601517", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "CEBUS MiniGolf-7-SC2 2560x1440.png", "id": "2898166337199752", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295661_2898166340533085_6797391979187378109_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5eS9FyAjgNEQ7kNvwGRSPe5&_nc_oc=AdoMcU7-UO4kQ1NbYKWYxEhbz2N1Qd0B7r1hfE5bLSEyYzgkFNXqELpq8qaVfbt8FfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRSC6RIYSNwaKVBEvPGIUg5SH-iL_xBgNtXgH71Eqb5aw&oe=6B0DB7D3"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-6-SC1_2560x1440.png", "id": "710873975262138", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_710873978595471_4844635543382100909_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0pLCiqojjnMQ7kNvwE-WbUB&_nc_oc=AdpFe3JXAIYBKFmp1LNqyK8_hm6zt6UsPqoL-u6MyH6xfmnWXnmSiRaww3tJFzfhFe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQwFCyl4kY13WkCMqLBEvXNNptmwCBNSNMG7iiF_ffRqA&oe=6B0DB2C1"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-9-SC4_2560x1440.png", "id": "24284559741203341", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827703_24284559747870007_1728458674463017053_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZLBDcJBW0sQ7kNvwEsUnNH&_nc_oc=AdqTxnDOSWXoX3f-kAsOLnQAJyX07TXoLDDyK6MJppo-MZIPx06BPYLKd9RsQEZX6PU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRei07YQgUfLJeK4t7BtffA6X3nLqIYvVReJ1C_aXRJAQ&oe=6B0DCF02"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-8-SC3_2560x1440.png", "id": "4148687502078455", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830021_4148687505411788_2130807848854402687_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wv3cDNIxUYUQ7kNvwHTnXZ1&_nc_oc=Ado6UIBa1gE1rICjwfzFtlq93-ii1H5qCPPS7jeGZkR13m4BnNmz2XuV588AdirekUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSzUNp_EwSG6ulSAe2eTueCGTmOQb7xOnADLBrN9bLpZw&oe=6B0DB5FD"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-10-SC5_2560x1440.png", "id": "2163063214163227", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825050_2163063217496560_3945081202565340583_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PT1yFnDKyDcQ7kNvwHsWTcT&_nc_oc=AdqKbrj-SBytXe61Rt-w1HWfADAiq0OrFGE-wVo4Azgcz_sZy31Dyn98pG79-lIZuD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTN4ngNVg2E4tomBfz4AlsEj-UVVH3eaJIO2YLNhY_JJw&oe=6B0DAE85"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Youtube Thumbnail (2560 x 1440 px).png", "id": "1067554828799111", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831382_1067554832132444_1820042300100226778_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PQjYO4wpNcoQ7kNvwFa_nD0&_nc_oc=Adp9qBkYOm-CYvIVWxeYSL7-W9o3cixQtrUR64nPUMz4ZI9aRqD02VxHzBWqej5NjRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQUmYijdrcqdlUqKn07NgMh_uxWuRKPEhJ9bbagd3wvEQ&oe=6B0DC699"}, "display_name": "Cebus", "keywords": ["monkey", "tag", "multiplayer", "horror", "onlyup"], "long_description": "**Join our Discord for news, sneak peeks, and community: https://discord.gg/rwCWTW3xuJ**\n\n# Explore Different Worlds\n\nEvery map brings a different way to move and play.\n\n- **Forest** \u2014 Climb through the trees and find your own routes.\n- **Ice Map** \u2014 Slide across slippery terrain and control your momentum.\n- **Cloud Map** \u2014 Bounce your way through a world in the sky.\n- **Beach Map** \u2014 Slow down, explore, and hang out with friends.\n- **Zero Gravity Map** \u2014 Leave the ground behind and float through zero gravity.\n\n# Take On the Game Modes\n\n- **Lazer Maze** \u2014 Dodge moving lasers and put your timing to the test.\n- **Glass Bridge** \u2014 Choose your panels carefully. The wrong one sends you falling.\n- **Only Up** \u2014 Climb a vertical parkour course where one fall resets your progress.\n- **Horror** \u2014 Explore dark areas filled with suspense and surprises.\n\n# Make Your Cebus Your Own\n\nMeet up at the **Mall**, visit the **Shop**, and unlock cosmetics and tools to change your look and how you play.\n\n- **Size Changer** \u2014 Shrink or grow your Cebus.\n- **Grappling Hook** \u2014 Hook on and swing across levels.\n- **Mod Menu** \u2014 Try fun in-game extras and settings.\n\nMaster a tricky climb, race friends to the top, or hang out and show off your style. How you spend your time in Cebus is up to you.", "short_description": "Run, climb, and swing with your arms in Cebus, a multiplayer VR playground full of gamemodes like mini golf, only up, horror, pvp, lazermaze, rock climbing and so much more"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://villanstudios.com/pages/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sora_vr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://villanstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": 